---

<Layout
	title="About | Narayan Ashanahalli"
	description="Product Designer & Prototyper building 0-to-1 experiences across AI, hardware, and digital infrastructure."
	fullWidth={true}
>
	<HomeNavigation />

	<div class="about-layout">
		<header class="about-header">
			<h1 class="about-title">About</h1>
		</header>

		<div class="about-divider"></div>

		<!-- Top Section: Image Slider Carousel -->
		<div class="about-slider-section">
			<ImageSlider
				variant="carousel"
				autoplay={true}
				indicatorType="dots"
				frameStrategy="adaptive"
				slides={sliderSlides}
			/>
		</div>

		<!-- Bio Section -->
		<div class="about-hero-grid">
			<div class="about-left-col">
				<div class="about-body">
					<p>
						👋 I'm Narayan Ashanahalli, a Product Designer &
						Prototyper building [0-to-1]&nbsp;experiences across AI,
						hardware, and digital infrastructure. With a foundation in
						architecture, I apply systems thinking and rapid
						prototyping to create digital products that feel responsive
						and grounded in existing ecosystems.
					</p>
					<p>
						🎯 I'm looking to work with people and teams shaping a new era of human–AI interaction—across physical AI, intelligent tools, and products that augment how people think, build, and live. People who are genuinely excited about this future and care as much about how these systems feel in use as what they can technically do.
					</p>
					<p>
						❓The question I keep coming back to: how do we design AI that understands the context around what people are doing and becomes part of how they think and act, rather than another system they have to manage? And at the core how to build for the technology can work alongside people while the interaction stays grounded in the task, the environment, and what they are actually trying to do.
					</p>
					<p>
						🔧 I'm currently working as a Design Researcher at Lab 4
						Cybernetics with <a
							href="https://pangaro.com/"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener noreferrer">Paul Pangaro</a
						>, building the lab's digital infrastructure: <a
							href="https://lab4cybernetics.vercel.app"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener noreferrer">the website</a
						>, a practitioner-scholar <a
							href="https://l4cybernetics.vercel.app/matching"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener noreferrer">matching platform</a
						>, and a knowledge graph system organizing <a
							href="https://publish.obsidian.md/lab4c"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener noreferrer">cybernetics concepts</a
						>.
					</p>
					<p>
						🤖 My thesis project, supported by the <a
							href="https://studioforcreativeinquiry.org/frff-grants-microgrants"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener noreferrer">Frank-Ratchye Further Fund</a
						>, explores how physically embodied AI can provide spatial
						task assistance through laser-pointing, bridging LLM
						reasoning with physical spatial referencing.
					</p>
					<p>
						💡 I'm learning that the best way to understand a new interaction is by building it. I design through building—moving between research, interaction design, prototyping, and code, using each to sharpen the others without losing the original intent. AI makes this process even more powerful by letting us build and learn in the same loop, while developing the judgment and heuristics to know what to preserve, what to question, and what the interaction should become.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			{/* DISABLED INFINITE CANVAS PANEL:
			<div class="about-right-col">
				<div class="about-canvas-container">
					<FloatingCanvas
						id="about-fc"
						pan="orbit"
						images={canvasImages}
						height="100%"
					/>
				</div>
			</div>
			*/}
		</div>

		<Footer />
		<div class="game-bottom-wrapper">
			<GhostRunner />
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="toggle-floater">
		<div class="sidebar-controls">
			<SoundToggle />
			<ThemeToggle />
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>

<style>
	.about-layout {
		width: 100%;
		max-width: 100%;
		box-sizing: border-box;
		padding: 80px 16px 0;
		margin: 0;
		background: var(--bg-primary);
		min-height: 100vh;
	}

	.toggle-floater {
		position: fixed !important;
		bottom: 20px !important;
		right: 20px !important;
		top: auto !important;
		margin: 0 !important;
		padding: 0 !important;
		z-index: 9999 !important;
		width: auto;
		display: flex;
		justify-content: flex-end;
	}

	.sidebar-controls {
		display: flex;
		gap: 1rem;
		align-items: center;
	}

	.about-header {
		max-width: 100%;
		margin-bottom: 16px;
		text-align: left;
	}

	.about-title {
		font-family: "Google Sans", sans-serif;
		font-size: 32px;
		font-weight: 450;
		line-height: 1.05;
		color: var(--text-primary);
		margin: 0;
	}

	.about-divider {
		width: 100%;
		height: 1px;
		background: var(--border-subtle);
		margin-bottom: 24px;
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.about-header,
		.about-divider {
			display: none !important;
		}
	}

	/* Bio Layout */
	.about-hero-grid {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		max-width: var(--content-col, 750px);
		margin-bottom: 40px;
	}

	.about-left-col {
		width: 100%;
	}

	.about-body {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 1.5rem;
		width: 100%;
	}

	.about-body p {
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: 16px;
		line-height: 1.35;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		font-weight: 300;
		text-align: left;
		margin: 0;
	}

	.about-body a {
		color: inherit;
		text-decoration: underline;
		text-underline-offset: 3px;
		text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
	}

	.about-body a:hover {
		color: var(--accent-secondary);
	}

	/* Full Width 100vw Bottom Image Slider Carousel Section (Zero Margins) */
	.about-slider-section {
		width: 100vw;
		position: relative;
		left: 50%;
		right: 50%;
		margin-left: -50vw;
		margin-right: -50vw;
		margin-bottom: 40px;
		overflow: hidden;
	}

	.about-slider-section :global(.image-slider) {
		margin-top: 0 !important;
		margin-bottom: 0 !important;
		padding-top: 0 !important;
		padding-bottom: 0 !important;
		max-width: 100% !important;
		width: 100% !important;
	}

	.about-slider-section :global(.image-slider[data-variant="carousel"] .slider-frame) {
		max-width: 68%;
		width: 68%;
		margin: 0 auto;
		aspect-ratio: 4 / 3 !important;
	}

	.about-slider-section :global(.image-slider[data-variant="carousel"] .slider-display) {
		aspect-ratio: unset !important;
		height: 100% !important;
		transition: none !important;
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.about-slider-section :global(.image-slider[data-variant="carousel"] .slider-frame) {
			max-width: 72% !important;
			width: 72% !important;
		}

		.about-slider-section :global(.image-slider[data-variant="carousel"] .slide) {
			padding: 0 4px !important;
		}
	}

	.about-slider-section :global(.image-slider[data-variant="carousel"] .slider-track) {
		height: 100%;
		align-items: center;
	}

	.about-slider-section :global(.image-slider[data-variant="carousel"] .slide) {
		height: 100%;
		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
		align-items: center;
	}

	.about-slider-section :global(.image-slider[data-variant="carousel"] .slide.prev),
	.about-slider-section :global(.image-slider[data-variant="carousel"] .slide.next) {
		transform: scale(0.88);
	}

	:global(.about-layout) :global(.site-footer) {
		width: calc(100% + 32px) !important;
		margin-left: -16px !important;
		margin-right: -16px !important;
		margin-top: 40px !important;
	}

	.game-bottom-wrapper {
		position: relative;
		width: calc(100% + 32px);
		margin-left: -16px;
		margin-top: 0px;
		margin-bottom: 0px;
		z-index: 0;
	}

	.game-bottom-wrapper :global(.ghost-game-container) {
		border-radius: 0;
		border: none;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
		width: 100%;
	}
</style>
</style>
